sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer as Customer Browser
    participant React as React SPA
    participant Backend as Spring Boot REST API
    participant DB as MySQL Database

    Customer->>React: Register / Login (email, password)
    React->>Backend: POST /api/auth/login
    Backend->>DB: Query User & BCrypt Verify
    Backend-->>React: Return AuthResponse (JWT Token)

    Customer->>React: Browse Movies & Select Showtime
    React->>Backend: GET /api/movies & GET /api/shows
    Backend-->>React: Return Movies & Show List

    Customer->>React: Open Seat Selection Page
    React->>Backend: GET /api/shows/{id}/seat-map
    Backend->>DB: Query ShowSeat records
    Backend-->>React: Return List<ShowSeat> (AVAILABLE, HELD, BOOKED)

    Customer->>React: Select Seats & Click "Reserve Seats (Hold)"
    React->>Backend: POST /api/bookings/hold
    Backend->>DB: SELECT FOR UPDATE (PESSIMISTIC_WRITE Lock on ShowSeat)
    Backend->>DB: Update ShowSeat to HELD & Insert Booking
    Backend-->>React: Return BookingResponse (Booking ID & Expiry)

    Customer->>React: Review Summary & Select Payment Sandbox
    React->>Backend: POST /api/bookings/{id}/confirm?paymentMethod=MOCK_CARD
    Backend->>DB: Insert Payment (SUCCESS) & Update Booking/ShowSeat (CONFIRMED)
    Backend-->>React: Return Confirmed Ticket

    Customer->>React: View Booking History
    React->>Backend: GET /api/bookings/my-history
    Backend-->>React: Return List<BookingResponse>
